<details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I book an appointment?</summary><p>Select Book Now, choose an available date and time, and complete the form. Remember the appointment date and time shown after you submit.</p></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What should I bring to the clinic?</summary><p>Bring your appointment details and any records or documents you would like to discuss with the doctor. A parent or guardian should accompany the child.</p></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I change or cancel my booking?</summary><p>Call the clinic at {{ config('clinic.phone') }} and provide your child's full name and appointment date. Clinic staff can help with changes and availability.</p></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>How can I check for updates?</summary><p>Open Check Appointment Status and enter your child's full name and the contact number used when booking.</p></details>
